# Uktabi Drake {G}, "Echo {1}{G}{G}" (CR 702.30a). Cast on turn 1 (paid with generic from Sol Ring's colorless mana and G mana), it came under Bot1's control since the beginning of their last upkeep, so at Bot1's turn 3 upkeep the echo ability
# triggers and asks for {1}{G}{G}. The colorless mana, a Mox Pearl (W) and 1 of the two G sources are tapped first (as much mana as the cost, one G
# short, a W in place of it): paying is not offered. With the last G source tapped it is paid ({1}{G}{G} spent: the generic with colorless mana,
# {G}{G} with G), and the W and the colorless left over stays in the pool. Uktabi Drake stays.
# Haste: it attacks on turn 1, the turn it was cast.

